lass=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Draccoon_Herald_Male_Addon_1_9a33d5.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Female\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Draccoon_Herald_Female_Addon_1_2872aa.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"w-Second_Addon_.28Staff.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Second_Addon_(Staff)\">Second Addon (Staff)</span></h2>\n<p>To obtain the second addon you must 'use' the <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Heralds%20Insignia\"><img alt=\"Heralds Insignia\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Heralds_Insignia_36183a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Heralds%20Insignia\">Heralds Insignia</a>.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Male\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Draccoon_Herald_Male_Addon_2_bdd0b6.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Female\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Draccoon_Herald_Female_Addon_2_2bfb0e.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["20-years-a-cook-quest"]}